"After you have started &kaddressbook; (either using one of the &kde; "
"application launchers &kickoff;, the classic &kmenu; or Lancelot Launcher, "
"or by typing <command>kaddressbook</command> at the command prompt or by "
"using the <guilabel>Contacts</guilabel> tab in &kontact;) the &kaddressbook; "
"main window will be displayed:"
